              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-28377?s=github&n=tempo&ns=github.com%2Fgrafana&t=golang&vr=%3C2.10.3",
              "help": {
                "text": "A vulnerability in Grafana Tempo exposes the S3 SSE-C encryption key in plaintext through the /status/config endpoint, potentially allowing unauthorized users to obtain the key used to encrypt trace data stored in S3.\n",
